# Markdown Briefing

## Minimum AUM Requirement

The **minimum assets under management (AUM)** required in the **Anchorage Police and Fire Retirement System 2025 investment consultant RFP** is:

- **At least $2 billion**

## Source Detail

This requirement appears in **Section 3**, **“Information Required From All Proposal Submitters,”** under **subsection A, “Minimum Consultant Requirements.”**

> “The firm must have at least **$2 Billion under management**.”

## Clarification

- This requirement applies to the **proposing investment consultant firm**
- It does **not** refer to individual client accounts

## Related Minimum Requirements

The same section also states that the firm must:

- Work with **public pension funds**
- Assign a **lead consultant with at least 10 years of investment experience**
