<CONTENT>The proposal submission deadline for the Oklahoma Public Employees Retirement System (OPERS) investment consulting services RFP (#515-22-200) was March 25, 2022, by 4:30 p.m. Central Time.

Relevant evidence from the RFP includes:
- Proposal Cover Sheet: “Proposal Deadline must be received by 4:30 pm CT March 25, 2022”
- Mandatory Requirements, Section II.B: “The deadline for receipt of proposals is 4:30 p.m. Central Time, on March 25, 2022.”
- Timeline, Section VI: “Proposals due (no later than 4:30 p.m. Central Time) March 25, 2022”

