# Markdown Briefing

## OPERS RFP Proposal Submission Deadline

**The proposal submission deadline** for the Oklahoma Public Employees Retirement System (**OPERS**) investment consulting services RFP (**#515-22-200**) was:

- **March 25, 2022**
- **4:30 p.m. Central Time**

## Supporting Evidence

The deadline is stated consistently in multiple sections of the RFP:

- **Proposal Cover Sheet:** “Proposal Deadline must be received by **4:30 pm CT March 25, 2022**”
- **Mandatory Requirements, Section II.B:** “The deadline for receipt of proposals is **4:30 p.m. Central Time, on March 25, 2022**.”
- **Timeline, Section VI:** “Proposals due (**no later than 4:30 p.m. Central Time**) **March 25, 2022**”

## Additional Submission Requirement

- Proposals had to be **submitted digitally** through the **OPERS file submission link**.
- **Late submissions** received after the stated deadline would be **rejected**.

## Direct Answer

**The proposal submission deadline was March 25, 2022, at 4:30 p.m. Central Time.**
