[role=assistant] <DESCRIPTION>The Boston Retirement System 2022 Investment Consulting Services RFP requires proposers to submit seven printed copies. The RFP also requires one electronic version.</DESCRIPTION>
<NAME>Seven printed copies.</NAME>
<CONTENT>In the Boston Retirement System 2022 Investment Consulting Services RFP, prospective consultants must submit seven (7) complete printed copies of the proposal. The RFP states: “Prospective Consultants must submit seven (7) complete printed copies of their Proposal, and one electronic version.” It also repeats this in the submission instructions: “Submit seven (7) printed copies of your Proposal in a sealed package and one (1) version electronically.”

So, the required number of printed copies is seven (7). Additionally, one printed copy must be labeled “Master Copy,” include original signatures, and be placed in a loose-leaf, three-ring binder.</CONTENT>
[role=assistant] <SUMMARY>
# Briefing

## Answer
The Boston Retirement System 2022 Investment Consulting Services RFP requires **seven (7) printed copies** of the proposal.

## Key Submission Requirements
- **Printed copies required:** **7**
- **Electronic copies required:** **1**
- **Special requirement:** One printed copy must be labeled **“Master Copy”**
- The **Master Copy** must:
  - include **original signatures**
  - be placed in a **loose-leaf, three-ring binder**

## Supporting Evidence
- The RFP states: **“Prospective Consultants must submit seven (7) complete printed copies of their Proposal, and one electronic version.”**
- The submission instructions also state: **“Submit seven (7) printed copies of your Proposal in a sealed package and one (1) version electronically.”**

## Conclusion
The required number of printed proposal copies is **seven (7)**.
</SUMMARY>
