<NAME>14 topics; last is D&I.</NAME>
<CONTENT>In the Overview of the ILPA Due Diligence Questionnaire v1.2 (released in September 2018), the document states: “The ILPA DDQ covers many topics related to fund diligence, including:” followed by a numbered list.

The list contains 14 fund diligence topics:

1. General Firm Information  
2. General Fund Information  
3. Investment Strategy  
4. Investment Process  
5. Team  
6. Alignment of Interest  
7. Market Environment  
8. Fund Terms  
9. Firm Governance/Risk/Compliance  
10. ESG  
11. Track Record  
12. Accounting/Valuation/Reporting  
13. Legal/Administration  
14. Diversity and Inclusion

Therefore:
- Number of fund diligence topics listed in the Overview: 14
- Last topic: Diversity and Inclusion

This is also consistent with the v1.2 change note stating that Section 14 (Diversity and Inclusion) was added in the 2018 release.</CONTENT>
