<CONTENT>In the Overview of the ILPA Due Diligence Questionnaire 2.0 (2021), the document says: “The ILPA DDQ covers many topics related to fund diligence, including:” and then lists 14 numbered topics.

They are:
1. General Firm Information  
2. General Fund Information  
3. Investment Strategy  
4. Investment Process  
5. Team  
6. Alignment of Interest  
7. Market Environment  
8. Fund Terms  
9. Firm Governance/Risk/Compliance  
10. ESG  
11. Track Record  
12. Accounting/Valuation/Reporting  
13. Legal/Administration  
14. Diversity and Inclusion  

So, the total number of fund diligence topics is 14, and the last one is “Diversity and Inclusion.”</CONTENT>
