- The completed proposal submission deadline was 5:00 p.m. PT on October 1, 2021.

The relevant language states:
- “Those who wish to be considered must submit their completed proposal, via email to the Point of Contact, by 5:00 p.m., PT, October 1, 2021.”
- It also says, “Any proposal delivered after the proposal deadline will not be considered.”

